{"title":"PlantUML语法入门教程","uid":"ea43905aa67084edcf2022ae489a5efe","slug":"PlantUML语法入门教程","date":"2024-03-26T03:43:47.000Z","updated":"2025-06-11T05:29:03.896Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/PlantUML语法入门教程.json","keywords":null,"cover":[],"content":"<h1 id=\"啊？什么？在痛苦地画UML类图？不如来简单了解一下PlantUML！\"><a href=\"#啊？什么？在痛苦地画UML类图？不如来简单了解一下PlantUML！\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"啊？什么？在痛苦地画UML类图？不如来简单了解一下PlantUML！\"></a>啊？什么？在痛苦地画UML类图？不如来简单了解一下PlantUML！</h1><h2 id=\"PlantUML简介\"><a href=\"#PlantUML简介\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"PlantUML简介\"></a>PlantUML简介</h2><p>PlantUML 是一个开源的工具，允许我们这样的<strong>懒狗</strong>使用简单直观的文本语言来创建 UML 图。虽然它支持多种类型的图表（如时序图、用例图、活动图等），但今天我们主要关注最常用的类图(Class Diagram)语法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么选择PlantUML画类图？\"><a href=\"#为什么选择PlantUML画类图？\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"为什么选择PlantUML画类图？\"></a>为什么选择PlantUML画类图？</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>文本化描述</strong> - 不用拖拽，直接用代码描述类的关系</li>\n<li><strong>版本控制友好</strong> - 可以直接纳入Git管理</li>\n<li><strong>快速修改</strong> - 不用担心调整布局，PlantUML会自动处理</li>\n<li><strong>标准化输出</strong> - 团队内部风格统一</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"类图基本语法\"><a href=\"#类图基本语法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"类图基本语法\"></a>类图基本语法</h2><h3 id=\"1-定义一个类\"><a href=\"#1-定义一个类\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 定义一个类\"></a>1. 定义一个类</h3><div class=\"language-txt\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">txt</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@startuml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">class User &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    -String name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    -int age</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +void login()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +void logout()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">&#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@enduml</span></span></code></pre></div><img src=\"/post/PlantUML%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/1.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<p>语法说明：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <code>class</code> 关键字定义类</li>\n<li>属性前使用 <code>-</code> 表示private，<code>+</code> 表示public，<code>#</code> 表示protected</li>\n<li>方法的完整语法是：<code>可见性 返回类型 方法名(参数列表)</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-类之间的关系\"><a href=\"#2-类之间的关系\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 类之间的关系\"></a>2. 类之间的关系</h3><div class=\"language-txt\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">txt</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@startuml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">class Animal &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +void eat()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">&#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">class Dog &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +void bark()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">&#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">class Cat &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +void meow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">&#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">Animal &lt;|-- Dog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">Animal &lt;|-- Cat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@enduml</span></span></code></pre></div><img src=\"/post/PlantUML%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/2.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<p>常用关系符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>继承关系：<code>&lt;|--</code></li>\n<li>实现接口：<code>&lt;|..</code></li>\n<li>组合关系：<code>*--</code></li>\n<li>聚合关系：<code>o--</code></li>\n<li>关联关系：<code>--&gt;</code></li>\n<li>依赖关系：<code>..&gt;</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-接口和抽象类\"><a href=\"#3-接口和抽象类\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 接口和抽象类\"></a>3. 接口和抽象类</h3><div class=\"language-txt\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">txt</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@startuml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">interface Playable &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +void play()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +void stop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">&#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">abstract class Instrument &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    -String name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +&#123;abstract&#125; void makeSound()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">&#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">class Piano &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +void makeSound()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">&#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">Playable &lt;|.. Piano</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">Instrument &lt;|-- Piano</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@enduml</span></span></code></pre></div><img src=\"/post/PlantUML%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/3.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<p>语法说明：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <code>interface</code> 定义接口</li>\n<li>使用 <code>abstract class</code> 定义抽象类</li>\n<li>抽象方法可以用 <code>&#123;abstract&#125;</code> 标记</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-关系的多重性\"><a href=\"#4-关系的多重性\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 关系的多重性\"></a>4. 关系的多重性</h3><div class=\"language-txt\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">txt</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@startuml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">class University &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +String name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">&#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">class Student &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +String id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +String name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">&#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">class Course &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +String code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    +String title</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">&#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">University &quot;1&quot; *-- &quot;many&quot; Student</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">Student &quot;many&quot; -- &quot;many&quot; Course</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@enduml</span></span></code></pre></div><img src=\"/post/PlantUML%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/4.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<p>多重性表示：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>“1” 表示一个</li>\n<li>“*” 或 “many” 表示多个</li>\n<li>“0..1” 表示零个或一个</li>\n<li>“1..*” 表示一个或多个</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"5-高级特性\"><a href=\"#5-高级特性\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 高级特性\"></a>5. 高级特性</h3><div class=\"language-txt\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">txt</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@startuml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">package &quot;用户管理&quot; &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    class User &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">        -String username</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">        -String password</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">        +void login()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    &#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    class UserProfile &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">        -String email</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">        -String phone</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    &#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">&#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">package &quot;权限管理&quot; &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    class Role &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">        -String name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">        +void grant()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    &#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    class Permission &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">        -String code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">        -String description</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    &#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">&#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">User &quot;1&quot; -- &quot;1&quot; UserProfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">User &quot;*&quot; -- &quot;*&quot; Role</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">Role &quot;*&quot; -- &quot;*&quot; Permission</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@enduml</span></span></code></pre></div><img src=\"/post/PlantUML%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/5.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<p>高级特性说明：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <code>package</code> 对类进行分组</li>\n<li>可以使用 <code>namespace</code> 定义命名空间</li>\n<li>可以使用 <code>note left of</code>、<code>note right of</code>、<code>note top of</code> 添加注释</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实用技巧\"><a href=\"#实用技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"实用技巧\"></a>实用技巧</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>布局控制</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"language-txt\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">txt</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@startuml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">left to right direction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">class A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">class B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">class C</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">A -- B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">B -- C</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@enduml</span></span></code></pre></div><ol start=\"2\">\n<li><strong>样式定制</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"language-txt\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">txt</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@startuml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">skinparam class &#123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    BackgroundColor White</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    ArrowColor Black</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">    BorderColor Black</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">&#125;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">class Example</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">@enduml</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"结语\"><a href=\"#结语\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"结语\"></a>结语</h2><p>以上就是PlantUML类图的主要语法，掌握这些基础语法就能画出清晰的类图了。记住一点：类图的重点是表达类之间的关系，不要过分关注图的样式，PlantUML会帮我们处理好布局问题。</p>\n<p>[图片说明：以上代码块中标注需要放置图片的位置，您可以使用PlantUML生成对应的图片后放置在那些位置]</p>\n","text":"啊？什么？在痛苦地画UML类图？不如来简单了解一下PlantUML！PlantUML简介PlantUML 是一个开源的工具，允许我们这样的懒狗使用简单直观的文本...","permalink":"/post/PlantUML语法入门教程","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"2.6k","symbolsTime":"2 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"技术教程","slug":"技术教程","count":1,"path":"api/categories/技术教程.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"PlantUML","slug":"PlantUML","count":1,"path":"api/tags/PlantUML.json"},{"name":"UML","slug":"UML","count":1,"path":"api/tags/UML.json"},{"name":"图表","slug":"图表","count":1,"path":"api/tags/图表.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%95%8A%EF%BC%9F%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%EF%BC%9F%E5%9C%A8%E7%97%9B%E8%8B%A6%E5%9C%B0%E7%94%BBUML%E7%B1%BB%E5%9B%BE%EF%BC%9F%E4%B8%8D%E5%A6%82%E6%9D%A5%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8BPlantUML%EF%BC%81\"><span class=\"toc-text\">啊？什么？在痛苦地画UML类图？不如来简单了解一下PlantUML！</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#PlantUML%E7%AE%80%E4%BB%8B\"><span class=\"toc-text\">PlantUML简介</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9PlantUML%E7%94%BB%E7%B1%BB%E5%9B%BE%EF%BC%9F\"><span class=\"toc-text\">为什么选择PlantUML画类图？</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E7%B1%BB%E5%9B%BE%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95\"><span class=\"toc-text\">类图基本语法</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#1-%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%B1%BB\"><span class=\"toc-text\">1. 定义一个类</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#2-%E7%B1%BB%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB\"><span class=\"toc-text\">2. 类之间的关系</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#3-%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%92%8C%E6%8A%BD%E8%B1%A1%E7%B1%BB\"><span class=\"toc-text\">3. 接口和抽象类</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#4-%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%9A%E9%87%8D%E6%80%A7\"><span class=\"toc-text\">4. 关系的多重性</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#5-%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7\"><span class=\"toc-text\">5. 高级特性</span></a></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%AE%9E%E7%94%A8%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7\"><span class=\"toc-text\">实用技巧</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E7%BB%93%E8%AF%AD\"><span class=\"toc-text\">结语</span></a></li></ol></li></ol>","author":{"name":"AstreoX","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/astreox.jpg","link":"/","description":"404 AstreoX not Found","socials":{}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"Github详解: 从入门到精通","uid":"647c4edecec5c6b48ebc0d64a7cb455e","slug":"Github详解-从入门到精通","date":"2025-05-11T16:07:54.000Z","updated":"2025-05-24T15:40:10.759Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/Github详解-从入门到精通.json","keywords":null,"cover":"https://imgconvert.csdnimg.cn/aHR0cHM6Ly91cGxvYWQtaW1hZ2VzLmppYW5zaHUuaW8vdXBsb2FkX2ltYWdlcy8xOTM0MTk4My05YjI2Y2RkOTM3NjA0NmE4LnBuZw?x-oss-process=image/format,png","text":"Git 与 GitHub 详解：从入门到精通引言哎呀也是叫我用上“从入门到精通”这个经典标题了，鉴于很多人搞不懂Git和Github的关系，而且也不怎么会使用G...","permalink":"/post/Github详解-从入门到精通","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"12k","symbolsTime":"11 mins."},"categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"技术","slug":"技术","count":3,"path":"api/tags/技术.json"},{"name":"Github","slug":"Github","count":2,"path":"api/tags/Github.json"},{"name":"教程","slug":"教程","count":2,"path":"api/tags/教程.json"},{"name":"入门","slug":"入门","count":2,"path":"api/tags/入门.json"}],"author":{"name":"AstreoX","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/astreox.jpg","link":"/","description":"404 AstreoX not Found","socials":{}}},"next_post":{}}